<title>USA: Environment One sees second half EPS rising.</title>
<headline>Environment One sees second half EPS rising.</headline>
<dateline>SCHENECTADY, N.Y. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Environment One Corp said on Thursday its second-half results for the fiscal year will be &quot;well ahead&quot; of first half.</p>
<p>The chairman, Steven Ardia, said in a company statement he was confident Environment One will grow at least 20 percent over 1995's $17.5 million in revenues and that this year's earnings will be at least 30 percent above last year's $0.20 earnings per share.</p>
</text>
